{$DATA.review}

Hi {$DATA.first_name|capitalize},

Your digital files are ready to download. You can access them using the links below:

{foreach from=$DOWNLOADS item=download}
{$download.name}: (Link expires on {$download.expire})
{$download.url}
{/foreach}

If the links above don't work, try copying and pasting them into your browser's address bar. You can also access these files from your account on our website.

Dear {$DATA.name},

You've received a gift card that can be used towards any purchase on our website.

Happy shopping!

From: {$DATA.first_name|capitalize} {$DATA.last_name|capitalize}
Amount: {$DATA.value}
Claim Code: {$DATA.code}
Gift Message: {$DATA.message}

-------------------

To redeem this gift card please enter the "Claim Code" above into the text field labeled "Promotional code or gift card" during checkout.

Why not spend it now?

Dear {$DATA.to},

Your friend {$DATA.from} thought you might be interested in '{$DATA.name}'.

{$DATA.name}
Product Link: {$DATA.link}

{$DATA.message}
